ThinkingEars-ASR

Original ASR implementation and lexicon:
AI开放剧本模拟器 V5
https://github.com/superalp1985/AI-Open-Scenario-Simulator

Original authors:
王秉钦 / 王大粘
金皓若 / 老金

This distribution extracts the Python-compatible ASR core and helper
functions from V5, makes model paths and vocabulary configurable, adds
a model-independent text enhancement API, and packages the lexicon.

The original noncommercial restriction is retained. See LICENSE.
Optional third-party acoustic models are downloaded separately and
remain governed by their original licenses.
